load ../infoflow-tracker-carriage.maude

--- ============================ COVERAGE ======================================

--- Coverage: consuming an UNVOUCHED queue into a sink that requires
--- integrity is an injection (the ready-read carriage).
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  readReady(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, lo) sinkRequires(wfA, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg injection .

--- Coverage: an unvouched writer filing into a VOUCHED queue is an
--- injection (file/finish are data sinks).
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  fileInto(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, hi) ruleIntegrity(wfA, lo)
  =>* C:Cfg injection .

--- Coverage: endorsement out of a vouched queue mints authority.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  endorse(wfB, trk) trackerVouched(trk, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg endorsedAuthority(wfB) .

--- Coverage: endorsement out of an unvouched queue is refused (the shipped
--- diagnostic).
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  endorse(wfB, trk) trackerVouched(trk, lo)
  =>* C:Cfg endorseRefused .

--- ============================ BITE ==========================================

--- Bite: a vouched queue feeding the same integrity-requiring sink never
--- injects — the carriage is the queue's vouched level, not a blanket taint.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  readReady(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, hi) sinkRequires(wfA, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg injection .

--- Bite: a vouched writer filing a vouched queue never injects.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  fileInto(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, hi) ruleIntegrity(wfA, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg injection .

--- Bite (the implicit-flow ruling): a claim carries no rule data — no level
--- assignment whatsoever makes a claim an injection.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  claimOf(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, hi) ruleIntegrity(wfA, lo)
  sinkRequires(wfA, hi)
  =>* C:Cfg injection .

--- Bite (self-laundering closed): filing into an unvouched queue and
--- endorsing out of it never reaches minted authority — the two-step one
--- actor controls cannot turn its own output into vouched state.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE :
  fileInto(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, lo) ruleIntegrity(wfA, lo)
  endorse(wfA, trk)
  =>* C:Cfg endorsedAuthority(wfA) .

--- Bite teeth: the LAX module mints authority from exactly that term — the
--- laundering the good module's No-solution above proves closed.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-INFOFLOW-TRACKER-CARRIAGE-LAX :
  fileInto(wfA, trk) trackerVouched(trk, lo) ruleIntegrity(wfA, lo)
  endorse(wfA, trk)
  =>* C:Cfg endorsedAuthority(wfA) .
